[00:28.87]The bonfire's tall, the horns are full
[00:31.73]The boats are lit from bow to stern
[00:34.50]Old Bjarki said he would not swim this year
[00:37.65]And Old Bjarki shall never learn!

[00:40.39]SPLASH! Hahaha!

[00:43.77]The sausages are burning on the coals
[00:46.33]The smith is dancing with the mayor's wife
[00:49.44]Someone's rowing backwards out the bay
[00:52.30]Having the greatest evening of his life!

[00:55.49]Who goeth in the water?
[00:57.55]NOT I! NOT I!
[01:01.41]Who goeth in the water?
[01:03.70]THY FRIEND! THY FRIEND!

[01:07.62]Kasta vin þinn í sæinn!
[01:10.16]Throw thy friend into the sea!
[01:13.18]He shall thank thee in the morning —
[01:15.76]Well... he shall not — but throw him! WHEE!
[01:19.55]Bál, bjórr ok brennivín!
[01:22.27]Bonfire, beer and burning-wine!
[01:25.51]The summer endeth either way
[01:27.98]So it endeth soaking wet tonight!

[01:37.36]The priest declined the seventh horn
[01:40.04]The eighth one he declined no more
[01:43.08]By the ninth he was singing the old gods' songs
[01:45.82]And conducting the waves from the shore!

[01:48.95]There goeth a rocket — sideways — WHOOSH!
[01:51.92]There goeth Bjarki's other shoe!
[01:54.56]The dog hath eaten fourteen sausages
[01:57.75]And the dog regretteth nothing — WOULD YOU?!

[02:01.01]Who goeth in the water?
[02:03.04]NOT I! NOT I!
[02:07.00]Who goeth in the water?
[02:09.22]THY FRIEND! THY FRIEND!

[02:13.14]Kasta vin þinn í sæinn!
[02:15.77]Throw thy friend into the sea!
[02:18.61]He shall thank thee in the morning —
[02:21.36]Well... he shall not — but throw him! WHEE!
[02:25.18]Bál, bjórr ok brennivín!
[02:27.82]Bonfire, beer and burning-wine!
[02:31.03]The summer endeth either way
[02:33.91]So it endeth soaking wet tonight!

[02:40.21]Hej! To the fire!
[02:41.45]Hej! To the sea!
[02:42.91]Hej! To the friend mid-air between!
[02:45.91]Hej! Hej! Hej! HEJ!

[03:01.31]Is the water cold?
[03:02.24]YES IT IS!
[03:03.62]Do we care at all?
[03:05.19]NO WE DON'T!
[03:06.54]Shall we do it again?
[03:08.16]KASTA! KASTA! KASTA!

[03:24.89]Kasta vin þinn í sæinn!
[03:27.30]Throw thy friend into the sea!
[03:30.22]He shall thank thee in the morning —
[03:32.79]Well... he shall not — but throw him! WHEE!
[03:36.66]Bál, bjórr ok brennivín!
[03:39.23]Bonfire, beer and burning-wine!
[03:42.27]The summer endeth either way
[03:45.33]So it endeth soaking wet tonight!

[03:54.66]"...worth it!"
[03:55.88]SKÁL!
